    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For twelve years, Guo Youshun has been "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "picking up",
            "ref": "v-pick-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " litter from a cliff. The cliff is located on Yuntai Mountain in Henan province. It’s 30 metres high. Guo has collected more than 100 tons of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "garbage",
            "ref": "v-garbage"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " over the years. People call him “Spiderman”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Guo’s tools are a piece of strong rope and an orange "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "helmet",
            "ref": "v-helmet"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". A trash bag and the rope are tied around his "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "waist",
            "ref": "v-waist"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Two "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "colleagues",
            "ref": "v-colleague"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " pull the rope to keep him safe."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One day, when Guo had just landed at the bottom of the cliff, a rock fell from above. It "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "crashed",
            "ref": "v-crash"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " into pieces just two metres away from him. Flying pieces from the rock struck Guo’s back and helmet hard."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Guo said, “I thought about quitting at that moment. But it wouldn’t be easy to find a new cleaner. So I just felt like I had to keep doing my job, and I had to do it well.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
